<title>FRANCE: American to announce further aircraft order.</title>
<headline>American to announce further aircraft order.</headline>
<dateline>LE BOURGET, France 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMR Corp's domestic U.S. carrier American Eagle said after announcing a billion dollar for regional jets at the Paris airshow on Tuesday that it expected to announce another order later today.</p>
<p>An official with the airline told Reuters the order was to be announced at a joint press conference with Canadian manufacturer Bombardier.</p>
</text>
